    field: "Maintain a current chemical inventory linked to task risk assessments and current supplier SDS. Before approval, assess toxicity, exposure route, quantity, physical form, frequency, compatibility and emergency needs. Prefer elimination or substitution; then use closed transfer, enclosure, local exhaust ventilation, segregation, safe work procedures and suitable PPE. Label secondary containers, brief workers in understood languages, inspect controls and reassess when products or processes change.",
